{"id":352536,"title":"这些用户体验设计的知识你都掌握了吗？","content":"<p>你好，我是炒炒。</p><p>到这里，《体验设计案例课》这门课程已经全部结束了。我给你准备了一个结课小测试，来帮助你检验自己的学习效果。</p><p>这套测试题共有 15 道题目，包括4道单选题和11道多选题，满分 150 分，系统自动评分。</p><p>还等什么，点击下面按钮开始测试吧！</p><p><a href=\"http://time.geekbang.org/quiz/intro?act_id=376&exam_id=1115\"><img src=\"./images/352536_1.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p><!-- [[[read_end]]] -->","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":283875,"user_name":"石云升","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":1024195,"ip_address":"","ucode":"78F1DD33EFD000","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/a0/c3/c5db35df.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1615969711,"is_pvip":false,"replies":[{"id":106330,"content":"哈哈，希望每次看都能给你带来不同的启发。\n\n知识就是那么奇怪，每次看都会有新的启发。","user_name":"作者回复","user_name_real":"炒炒","uid":1844738,"ctime":1621434746,"ip_address":"","comment_id":283875,"utype":1}],"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100069101,"comment_content":"没有满分，看来还是得复习一遍。希望后面还能有加餐。","like_count":2,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1844738,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/1c/26/02/ffe08015.jpg","nickname":"炒炒","note":"","ucode":"E30F4B204705CC","race_medal":0,"user_type":2,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":517169,"discussion_content":"哈哈，希望每次看都能给你带来不同的启发。\n\n知识就是那么奇怪，每次看都会有新的启发。","content_length":42,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1621434746,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":true,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"{\"reply\":true,\"user_type\":2}","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":387349,"user_name":"ifelse","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":2550743,"ip_address":"浙江","ucode":"D0565908C99695","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/26/eb/d7/90391376.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1707022926,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":3,"score":2,"product_id":100069101,"comment_content":"130分","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":382631,"user_name":"翘楚","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":2408154,"ip_address":"美国","ucode":"35AB8472D21456","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/24/be/da/c6eaff1b.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1697695513,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100069101,"comment_content":"我必须说炒炒老师的课太棒了! 很惭愧，我2021年买的课，2023年也就是最近几天才看完。前两年的时候设计工作上缺乏很多的思考，没有建立体系化的思考能力。所以看的时候看一点就认为用不上加上更不知道怎么和工作串联起来，就没再读了。但是最近再刷，真是老师的没节课都是收货良多，解决了我脑袋里的好多问题。。。\n我一定要再说一遍炒炒老师你超棒的！！！我相信这个课程真的会对我后面的设计工作助力很多，也给我职业规划带来新的思考。","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":296468,"user_name":"Mok Waitram","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c1","uid":2409616,"ip_address":"","ucode":"FA7808FC5B426F","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/24/c4/90/0808996a.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1622988190,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":100069101,"comment_content":"看完了，请问炒炒现在是在哪个银行呀？","like_count":0,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1024195,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/a0/c3/c5db35df.jpg","nickname":"石云升","note":"","ucode":"78F1DD33EFD000","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":540239,"discussion_content":"老师在平安银行","content_length":7,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1639997686,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]}]}